'''Ice Phoenix''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] [[:Category:Pets|pet]] that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Winter Item Pack]] for 1,299 Robux during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended and the gamepass has gone offsale.
== Appearance ==
Ice Phoenix is similar to the [[Frostbird]] pet, but it isn't pixelated. It is more thin and completely blue. It has a frost-like effect with 2 blue fire effects coming from the tip of its wings.

== Trivia ==
* This is one of three phoenix pets in [[Murder Mystery 2]], the other two being [[Phoenix]] and [[Frostbird]].
*Its model derives form the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/101078559/Icy-Arctic-Fowl| Icy Arctic Fowl], purchasable from the avatar shop for 500 Robux.

